[en.EVENT_LPLAB_19]
Las Pegasus Lab Research Project Application: Code 019. <=Cake is a Lie=>

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_19_desc]
Code 019. <=Cake is a Lie=> : Aims to develop a magic-guidance device that allows the army to move quickly over short distances on the battlefield. Prototype: Mirror.

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_19_o0]
Interesting

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_215]
Las Pegasus Lab Research Project Application: Code 215. <=New Cider=>

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_215_desc]
Code 215.“New Cider”: Aims to develop an improved SSCS-6000 machine that can produce cider without the need for quality inspection, while still maintaining a decent taste. Prototype: Super Speedy Cider Squeezy 6000.

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_215_o0]
Interesting

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_247]
Las Pegasus Lab Research Project Application: Code 247. <=Giant Muffin=>

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_247_desc]
Code 247.“Giant Muffin”: Aims to develop an entertainment product that can be exported to Cloudsdale. Currently, there is only one potential customer, but the customer has a huge purchasing demand. Please don’t get it wrong, the product is a normal-sized muffin, but the user’s body will become huge in a short time after taking it. Prototype: Muffin.

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_247_o0]
What?

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_247_o2]
Great!

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_546]
Las Pegasus Lab Research Project Application: Code 546. <=Square Root=>

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_546_desc]
Code 546. <=Square Root=> : Aims to develop an automatic computation tool powered by unicorn’s magic. Prototype: A tool named “Computer” accordin to information collected from human world from the Free Equestria. Its computation power is around 0.83 TW (short for Twilight Sparkle, unit of computation, measured by the number of 546-square-root calculation time per second), while introducing magic could possibly improve that to 1.4 TW.

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_546_o0]
Interesting

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_818]
Las Pegasus Lab Research Project Application: Code 818. <=Experimental Music=>

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_818_desc]
Code 818. <=Experimental Music=> : Aims to develop a soundwave-based weapon. Prototype: A native instrument from the Yaks.

[en.EVENT_LPLAB_818_o0]
Interesting

